{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1793762345299, "sessionID": "ses_e5b6ee943ffesKPS9YSXB3CFpc", "part": {"id": "prt_1a49138dc001lANhvC1gzF1y2a", "messageID": "msg_1a49132c1001LpMo8ymBssZImO", "sessionID": "ses_e5b6ee943ffesKPS9YSXB3CFpc", "type": "text", "text": "AuditService depends on **UserService** for identity resolution. UserService in turn depends on **UsersPostgresDatabase**, and its read replica is configured by **`ORDER_DB_URL`**\u2014a historical name retained because three deployment scripts read it.\n\nThe dependency chain is:\n\n`AuditService \u2192 UserService \u2192 UsersPostgresDatabase`\n\nThe graph also records **AuditIcebergTable** as AuditService\u2019s storage destination, but does not identify it as part of identity resolution. No named API or direct configuration key for AuditService is recorded.", "time": {"start": 1793762343132, "end": 1793762345295}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_0468bdcb3bc292f8016aeaa427161487d2814542caa6d874dd", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
